## Quick start

1. Open Claude Code in this repository.
2. Ask for the agent and name the spec:

   ```
   @cypress-self-healer heal  
   ```

3. Optional: paste the error text or the nightly report entry. This saves one run.
4. Wait for the first result. It lists every failure, its cause, and the planned fix.
5. Answer its questions. It asks one at a time and marks one choice as recommended.
6. At the end, read the diff and choose: keep it or revert it.

### Useful variations

| You type | What happens |
|---|---|
| `@cypress-self-healer heal <spec>` | Heals the whole spec |
| `@cypress-self-healer heal <spec>, only the test " "` | Focuses on that one test with a temporary `.only`, and removes it afterwards |
| `@cypress-self-healer heal <spec>. Nightly error: <paste>` | Starts from the nightly error |
| `@cypress-self-healer check <spec> for flakiness` | Runs it up to 3 times. It does not edit a spec that passes. |

